"alt": "Genentech's innovative anti-LY6G6D/CD3 bispecific antibody (LY6G6D-TDB) demonstrates potent anti-tumor efficacy in colorectal cancer (CRC) models, both as a standalone treatment and in combination with PD-1 blockade. The most recent research findings have revealed that LY6G6D has emerged as a potential target for the treatment of colorectal cancer. CUSABIO has successfully developed the recombinant antibody specifically targeting human LY6G6D, demonstrating excellent binding activity with both recombinant human LY6G6D protein and recombinant monkey LY6G6D protein.",
